From 65711093667e67d2806ac3e8843b55f0d70fa7fe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: keptn42 <keptn42@noreply.codeberg.org>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 21:23:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] moe prefill forms behind R4D_MOE_PF2: wide gather,
 parallel scan and map prefix, 256-column down

In a prefill chunk moe_gather loads two bytes a lane and waits on every
slot, moe_scatter scans on one thread, and so does the run map's prefix.
R4D_MOE_PF2=1, or a mask of the parts: 2 a wave a token and 16 bytes a
lane with every slot's row in flight, 4 its column groups last first, 8 a
parallel scan with the tail folded into the placement, 16 the map prefix
in parallel, 32 a 256-column run-aligned down tile (w4). Each part keeps
its sums in the same order or is integers: bit-identical. Unset, every
launch is as before.
