From: keptn42 <keptn42@noreply.codeberg.org>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 21:49:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] r4d_selftest: the R4D_MOE_PF2 aligned-form pass at every
 class's own geometry, fp8a8 included

moe_q4_gemm holds the run-aligned form under parts 16 and 64 to the form
without them as well, so the block-fp8 instance of the early weight issue
and the narrow classes' pad tiles are compared byte for byte too. Past 512
experts the launcher builds no run map and there is no aligned launch, so
the pass is skipped there rather than failed.
---
